Persist the allocated forward port when opentenbase_ctl creates pgxc nodes
(issue #76):

The installer allocates node_port/pooler_port/forward_port, and writes
forward_port into postgresql.conf, but build_create_pgxz_node_cmd() only
emitted HOST and PORT in CREATE/ALTER NODE. pgxc_node.node_forward_port
therefore stayed 0. The forward manager then tried to use port 0 and
failed its first distributed write; FlushFnBuffer called
TermFidBackendProc(), which SIGTERMed every backend holding a local_fid
and the client saw ERROR 57P01.

Use the parser's actual option name (FORWARD, not FORWARD_PORT) so the
catalog receives the allocated forward port. A real HCE 2.0 aarch64
install with this change reports cn=11005 and dn=11008 in
pgxc_node.node_forward_port, and a 100-row distributed INSERT/query
completes successfully.
diff --git a/contrib/opentenbase_ctl/src/cluster/cluster.cpp b/contrib/opentenbase_ctl/src/cluster/cluster.cpp
index 16fb511..191b657 100644
--- a/contrib/opentenbase_ctl/src/cluster/cluster.cpp
+++ b/contrib/opentenbase_ctl/src/cluster/cluster.cpp
@@ -184,10 +184,10 @@ std::string build_create_pgxz_node_cmd(NodeInfo *node, OpentenbaseConfig* instal
         {
             // 本节点默认会生成一个IP为 localhost/端口为5432 的记录，需要修改一下节点路由的IP/Port
             // ALTER NODE cn001 with(HOST='172.16.16.49',PORT=11000);
-            create_sql += "ALTER NODE " + install->nodes[i].name + " WITH (HOST='"+ install->nodes[i].ip +"', PORT=" + std::to_string(install->nodes[i].port) +");";
+            create_sql += "ALTER NODE " + install->nodes[i].name + " WITH (HOST='"+ install->nodes[i].ip +"', PORT=" + std::to_string(install->nodes[i].port) + ", FORWARD=" + std::to_string(install->nodes[i].forward_port) + ");";
         } else {
             // CREATE NODE cn001 WITH (TYPE='coordinator', HOST='172.16.16.49', PORT=11000);
-            create_sql += "CREATE NODE " + install->nodes[i].name + " WITH (TYPE='"+ node_type +"', HOST='"+ install->nodes[i].ip +"', PORT=" + std::to_string(install->nodes[i].port) +");";
+            create_sql += "CREATE NODE " + install->nodes[i].name + " WITH (TYPE='"+ node_type +"', HOST='"+ install->nodes[i].ip +"', PORT=" + std::to_string(install->nodes[i].port) + ", FORWARD=" + std::to_string(install->nodes[i].forward_port) + ");";
         }
     }
 
